  "rarity": "Common",
  "lore": "Most of the brigade only notices Shift Sentinel when something is missing, which is exactly the point. Shift Sentinel guards the perimeter of the kitchen: access, secrets and policy, with an audit trail for every exception; the image the crew uses for it is the locked dry store and the keyring that never leaves the belt. The card calls out Coverage Matrix, Continuity, Guardian: the checks Shift Sentinel runs before calling anything ready. In the canon crosswalk this card is a provisional match for Watchtower Yoru.",
  "signature_phrase": "Full Coverage, then everything else.",
  "workflow": {
    "summary": "Shift Sentinel guards the perimeter of the kitchen: access, secrets and policy, with an audit trail for every exception.",
    "inputs": [
      "access requests",
      "policy set",
      "scan findings",
      "secret inventory"
    ],
    "outputs": [
      "allow / deny decision",
      "audit record",
      "remediation ticket"
    ],
    "proof_gate": "Policy gate: no access or release without a policy match and a recorded approver."
